 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lovely gesture. Is he interested in movies, zoos, or theme parks? The flip turn, also known as the back flip, is a great stunt to learn. It shows off your flip skills without being too big. The basic flip turn can be done for under ten dollars, and there are cheaper options too, like water wings. Then start with water wings and work up to flip turns. There are also swimming lessons that could help with confidence. Nice. Let me know if you need any more help finding one.",
